.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
\fBTest\fP base class for unit testing\&.

.PP
Usage example:
.IP "1." 4
define default constructor and run() function
.IP "2." 4
in run() function, use the macros provided to test whether desired conditions apply or not\&.
.PP

.PP
Examples:
.IP "\(bu" 2
check whether the floating point value, a, is equal to b within given tolerance, tol:

.PP
_equal(a,b,tol);
.IP "\(bu" 2
check whether a boolean conditions applies:

.PP
_test(isoparametric==false);
.IP "\(bu" 2
add a message to a failure report:

.PP
_fail("for this input this did not work");
.IP "\(bu" 2
report that a test passed: if (\&.\&.\&.) _succeed();
.PP

.PP
Obtain a fail/succeed report after running the test\&.

.PP
test\&.report(); 
